<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuania March jobless rate edges down to 6.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Lithuania March jobless rate edges down to 6.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unemployment in March was 6.2 percent in Lithuania versus a 6.3 percent figure for February, the labour exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p> LITHUANIAN UNEMPLOYMENT    March '97   Feb '97   March '96</p>
<p> Unemployment rate (pct)    6.2	   6.3	 8.3</p>
<p> Number of jobless	    108,200     110,900   N/A</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 223 517</p>
</text>
